354
00:18:31,030 --> 00:18:33,680
ダンゴムシのポーズしてない？
Isn't it in a pill bug pose?

355
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:36,130
何してるんだろう？
What is it doing?

356
00:18:36,230 --> 00:18:38,430
何これ！？
What is this!?

357
00:18:40,230 --> 00:18:41,730
露出者？
An exhibitionist?

358
00:18:41,730 --> 00:18:43,430
変態の類？
Some kind of pervert?

359
00:18:43,730 --> 00:18:46,180
