00:22:12,211 --> 00:22:16,461
まあ、まあ正常なVtuberの索敵、
Well, well, searching like a normal VTuber...

429
00:22:19,261 --> 00:22:25,711
正常な範囲の索敵のじゃー。
Searching within a normal range, noja~

430
00:22:30,211 --> 00:22:32,911
いや調子に乗っちゃ駄目なんだよ、お主ら。
No, you can't get cocky, you guys.

431
00:22:33,161 --> 00:22:36,461
ねえ。調子に乗るからミスるんだよ、お主ら。
Right? It's because you get cocky that you mess up, guys.

432
00:22:36,911 --> 00:22:38,711
2回目だからってねえ。
Just because it's the second time, right?

433
00:22:38,861 --> 00:22:40,211
ねえ、お主ら。
Right, guys?

434
00:22:40,461 --> 00:22:43,711
駄目じゃん、調子に乗ったりしちゃね。
No good, getting carried away like that.

435
00:22:44,311 --> 00:22:46,211
わしはしないよ、そんなこと。
I don't do that kind of thing.

436
00:22:46,611 --> 00:22:47,911
わしは乗らない。
I don't get cocky.

437
00:22:48,211 --> 00:22:51,011
何回でも初心を忘れずに、
No matter how many times, never forgetting the beginner's mindset,

438
00:22:53,211 --> 00:22:55,211
初々しさ、あり。
keeping it fresh.

439
00:22:56,111 --> 00:23:00,261
デビュー1ヶ月の新人Vtuberあちちめら。
One-month-since-debut rookie VTuber Achichi Mela.

440
00:23:00,711 --> 00:23:02,561
初々しさ二重丸。
Freshness: double circle!

441
00:23:03,461 --> 00:23:04,811
残り15。
15 remaining.

442
00:23:05,061 --> 00:23:07,261
残り15。いいペース！うん。
15 remaining. Good pace! Yep.

443
00:23:07,961 --> 00:23:09,811
はい4号車ー！
Yes, Car 4~!

444
00:23:10,061 --> 00:23:12,211
ちょっとすごい。
A little bit amazing.

445
00:23:12,861 --> 00:23:14,611
ちょっとね、ちょっと。ちょっとだから、ちょっと。
Just a little, just a little. Only a little, so just a bit.

446
00:23:14,811 --> 00:23:17,911
調子乗ってない、ちょっとじゃから。ちょっとじゃろ。みんなさ、
I'm not getting cocky, it's just a little bit. It's just a little, right? Everyone,

447
00:23:18,611 --> 00:23:21,011
進めたら嬉しいじゃろ？
you're happy when you make progress, right?

448
00:23:21,111 --> 00:23:24,411
そんな気持ちを込めてみて、一応星3ぐらい。
Putting that feeling into it, just about three stars.

449
00:23:24,511 --> 00:23:26,211
星3ぐらい。うん。
Around three stars. Yep.

450
00:23:26,361 --> 00:23:27,861
まあまあまあまあ。
Well, well, well, well.

451
00:23:28,111 --> 00:23:30,911
「なかなかやるやん」ぐらいならいいんじゃない？
